Third-party RTL vendored into this repository
=============================================

These files are NOT authored by this project. They are pinned snapshot copies
of upstream open-source RTL, vendored (rather than added as git submodules) so
that the exact hardware under test is committed alongside the testbench and the
mutation-testing harness can plant bugs into a local copy.

Nothing in third_party/ has been modified from upstream. Any change would defeat
the purpose of using it: this RTL is here precisely because the testbench was
*not* written against it, which is what makes it an honest check on the
verification environment.


